>    - A **volatility** (std dev of log-return per day)
> 3. For each ticker:
>    - Predict log-price at t+nday:  
>      `E[log P_{t+nday}] ≈ log P_t + μ_i * nday`
>    - Convert to level: `P̂_{t+nday} = P_t * exp(μ_i * nday)`
>    - Growth prediction returned: `P̂_{t+nday} - P_t`
